  <item>
    <title>05. 我在洞中寸步难行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b50672cace72dff8311af9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b50672cace72dff8311af9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jan 2024 13:34:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgv8fkFhcHi-PVFWAsvjcXJTjlCm.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>《不在家》记录了我和朋友们外出游玩的过程，是我音频作品的一个系列。它们是我无数个不成熟、不深刻、也不寂寞的瞬间，记录并整理下这些声音，让我在过往的时间中，得到一些珍贵的人生注脚。如果你喜欢《不在家》，并想促成一些合作，欢迎联系我：wanjunbeing@gmail.com</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>在贵州的最后一站，朋友带我们来到交麻干代寨的天星悬棺洞。这里只能坐船进入，依靠船夫接送，我们丢掉了现代社会的大部分属性，仅利用小手电照明，开始探索这个神秘洞穴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看到悬在半空中的木棺，看到散落在岩石上的人骨，看到后人祭祀的痕迹，看到克苏鲁一样的钟乳石，看到身边无边的黑暗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对洞葬有兴趣：</span><a href="https://read.douban.com/ebook/13806453/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://read.douban.com/ebook/13806453/?dt_dapp=1"><span>大山深处的神秘洞葬</span></a><span>，也欢迎评论交流。贵州游玩的系列就结束了，感谢大家的订阅、收听、转发。请期待之后《不在家》的节目！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>录音/制作/口述</span></strong><span>：wanjun</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Special Thanks</span></strong><span>：214</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音乐/Music</span></strong><span>：《Violin Concerto in G minor, RV 315 'Summer'》《my-lazy-day-by-otis-galloway-from-filmmusic-io》《We All Need Adventures STEMS BASS》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsCneAFod53KnaIqu7s9WWvRIdT4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqy_qogvwjfiJq4jJJgjwYnVZrMF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7KcRf413wJVQX1tHirAFErWm06.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgmDgwbiHqzrmGpNWlMizKLhJojQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQCufSWtIRMs_uvFCLkiLh80Z1v.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZUsNK_BEdjOY0i5QyzM2UenQ0b.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftw6wYh5D5bbw6qNmnbFgtV1-CKP.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkdFbMntKQWXBH9451aCFpj_AZjr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqs-Kgoz6irjEnKPxj2rQ7Mw-o9d.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8Gf_GzTXzyUu_8h5x98mxOmFJP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu58dRaatQjWxBHjhCnFbhgmu6H8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8BXzxbEplTEAuga2PlINxrH0QB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8FQTIppqfF3rZtnaDZJVA0gz52.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foxgq-h1RP8pkzGV1UuEzpi0Pll-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLZfI8kHkS_EThQGBtgMVBbfMtk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYk4h-WI0pdNPk6XHRDj-wMDOsP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTDCZ7KZvP5owmEERNY6O2ndUpu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltbzGVhkC7M0wsn66TfqI8v2s2gQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrcvG68XCFw-vYbzdVmjGEcwlW5g.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEDwA__6iP81U68CMVn4j6EUl0F.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3UCwgjFQG2VibBwPkocXfL4G_k.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgDoElBV4SnhccF5vuFu-KMP9Yfc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtaO7hj3zcjOpmEPH7FWgPW9XMzI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjld0wdHdSPmSZSOZlpbxfQw6a_C.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
