  <item>
    <title>04. 冰臼之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659faf5b6d045a7f5ed3bee2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659faf5b6d045a7f5ed3bee2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jan 2024 09:05:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgv8fkFhcHi-PVFWAsvjcXJTjlCm.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>什么是冰臼景观呢？在去之前，我没有做任何准备，只知道它是冰川时代的产物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每隔1.5亿年左右，地球会进入到所谓的冰河时代中，每次约持续5000万年。在冰河时代中，气候异常寒冷，地球表面持续覆盖着大规模冰川。在这么漫长、缓慢的过程中，冰川携带大量冰沙碎屑往前行进的活跃时期，叫做冰川期。当气温回升，冰川停止前进、缓慢后退时，此时就进入了间冰期。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lreZb_6yl511VbU_BuA82QtF0D3x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liplyuxf9H6mvuvLjS4AYjcMjkKs.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8uBZIegPrd3pebSB3n7a1nj2-j.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loYspnxOfAS0MOFz3Y6bovK6VIuW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljQivS0rsbAz74OibVoDAsBJXYyu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkXb3jIymAbter3ZIb4uxEltlE5H.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lghmzzjHr3n3dAIbW8r2Y6uc5iJ2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgDAwCx2KSxFQ6CNd1p3_ynC2HKx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnGSt_LWG_p_MCwYpUmFG2dRCL0g.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft49QPcOAQNp8FOd_8QL7iBxb4SQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn37v_AkbiMQaFo7ZVeLs5BL4jFZ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lldvVvG4F1r1ixJ7k4V_P0YRZDSV.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>录音/制作/口述：</span></strong><span>wanjun</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音乐/Music：</span></strong><span>《Nocturne in E flat major, Op. 9 no. 2》《The Boss Is In by Otis Galloway》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>《不在家》记录了我和朋友们外出游玩的过程，是我音频作品的一个系列。它们是我无数个不成熟、不深刻、也不寂寞的瞬间，记录并整理下这些声音，让我在过往的时间中，得到一些珍贵的人生注脚。如果你喜欢《不在家》，并想促成一些合作，欢迎联系我：wanjunbeing@gmail.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
